      "The others have 5 thousands. Compare hundreds: 5,028 has 0, 5,208 has 2 and 5,280 has 2. Then compare tens: 0 < 8, so 5,208 < 5,280."
     ],
     "answer": "4,999; 5,028; 5,208; 5,280."
    },
